alic>BRAF</italic>: rs10487888, rs1733832, rs1267622, rs13241719, rs17695623, rs17161747, rs17623382 and rs6944385; <italic>ERBB2</italic>: rs2952155, rs2952156 and rs1801200; <italic>KRAS</italic> (block 1): rs12305513, rs12822857 and rs10842508; <italic>KRAS</italic> (block 2): rs12579073, rs10842513, rs4623993, rs6487464, rs10842514 and rs11047917; <italic>NMI</italic>: rs394884, rs11551174, rs289831, rs3771886 and rs11683487; <italic>PIK3CA</italic>: rs2865084, rs7621329, rs1517586, rs2699905, rs7641889, rs7651265, rs7640662 and rs2677760.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn3"><label>a</label><p>Compared with common haplotype. Bold text indicates positive results, either by <italic>P</italic>-value or CI ranges that do not cross 1.00.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>